                "content": "```\nInput: intervals = [[1,4],[2,3],[3,4]]\nOutput: [-1,2,-1]\nExplanation: There is no right interval for [1,4] and [3,4].\nThe right interval for [2,3] is [3,4] since start2 = 3 is the smallest start that is >= end1 = 3.\n```"
            }
        ]
